<div class="my-6 space-y-3" aria-label="Time comparisons for powers of ten seconds">
  <p><math><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math> (1 Thousand) seconds is 16 minutes.</p>
  <p><math><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></math> (1 Million) seconds is 11 days.</p>
  <p><math><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></math> (1 Billion) seconds is 31 years.</p>
</div>
